WEBVTT

01:21.350 --> 01:26.880
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.530 --> 01:29.530
[Episode 35]

01:32.280 --> 01:33.880
The other nine dike breaches

01:34.789 --> 01:36.920
were under your authority, Mentor.

01:59.759 --> 02:01.040
It has been a very long time

02:01.040 --> 02:03.120
since I last heard words like these.

02:06.150 --> 02:07.680
Please forgive me, Mentor.

02:07.840 --> 02:09.190
Perhaps because I

02:10.000 --> 02:11.870
just had a brush with death,

02:12.680 --> 02:13.470
I've

02:14.450 --> 02:16.290
lost all sense of reverence.

02:29.590 --> 02:31.000
Do you really think

02:31.870 --> 02:33.310
that a few words like those

02:33.310 --> 02:35.030
would make me kill you?

02:38.030 --> 02:38.910
No.

02:39.310 --> 02:41.000
You're wrong. You're wrong.

02:42.590 --> 02:44.190
You did well.

02:46.560 --> 02:48.360
I hope someone like you

02:48.360 --> 02:49.770
can always be by my side—

02:51.030 --> 02:52.360
to voice opposing views

02:52.680 --> 02:54.340
or pour cold water on my plans.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.079
That way,

02:55.430 --> 02:58.120
I can remain clear-headed at all times.

02:59.430 --> 03:00.160
You did well.

03:03.800 --> 03:05.750
Get well soon.

03:06.000 --> 03:06.860
The new reforms

03:07.000 --> 03:08.400
are full of tangled issues.

03:08.400 --> 03:09.830
The Imperial Court needs you,

03:09.830 --> 03:11.910
and so do I.

03:12.910 --> 03:13.910
His Majesty has ordered

03:13.910 --> 03:17.030
the Three Judiciary Offices to investigate
your case thoroughly.

03:17.030 --> 03:18.310
If the investigation

03:18.310 --> 03:20.440
ultimately implicates Wang Xuanfan,

03:20.520 --> 03:22.650
even though he is a Grand Secretary...

03:24.240 --> 03:26.770
he'll still be punished
according to the law.

03:28.079 --> 03:29.140
Thank you, Mentor.

03:30.030 --> 03:31.360
Rest and recover well.

03:32.840 --> 03:33.900
I'll head back now.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.730
Be careful on the road, Mentor.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.160
Just now,

04:00.250 --> 04:02.240
I saw the Senior Grand Secretary leave

04:02.240 --> 04:04.190
with a very unpleasant expression.

04:04.190 --> 04:06.720
Did something go wrong
in your conversation?

04:07.120 --> 04:07.910
He asked me

04:07.910 --> 04:10.030
not to pursue the matter
with Wang Xuanfan,

04:10.030 --> 04:11.560
but I shut him down.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.340
Though I'd guessed...

04:15.240 --> 04:17.040
he would plead for Wang Xuanfan,

04:17.390 --> 04:18.360
I didn't expect

04:20.220 --> 04:21.269
him to

04:21.269 --> 04:22.720
go this far.

04:26.040 --> 04:26.830
I said

04:27.510 --> 04:29.680
that six of the river administration posts

04:29.680 --> 04:30.870
involved in riverworks corruption

04:30.870 --> 04:33.070
were held by Wang Xuanfan's disciples,

04:33.310 --> 04:34.830
and all he said was,

04:35.390 --> 04:36.920
"That was a bit much."

04:40.040 --> 04:41.500
How lightly he treated it.

04:42.159 --> 04:43.000
So

04:43.750 --> 04:44.680
because of that,

04:45.430 --> 04:46.960
you refuted him to his face?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.240
I had to press him

04:50.720 --> 04:52.250
to see what he would choose.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.840
But after testing him today,

04:57.240 --> 04:58.000
I realized

04:58.800 --> 05:01.000
his ties to Wang Xuanfan

05:01.560 --> 05:03.560
run far deeper than I ever expected.

05:05.070 --> 05:06.160
In that case,

05:06.560 --> 05:08.560
we'll have to take precautions—

05:10.240 --> 05:11.970
not just in the Imperial Court,

05:12.510 --> 05:13.710
but also in business.

05:14.390 --> 05:14.920
I'll need to

05:14.920 --> 05:16.160
stay fully alert.

05:17.870 --> 05:19.430
We should also

05:20.160 --> 05:21.120
send a letter

05:21.390 --> 05:22.720
to Grandmother and Yao.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.150
How about

05:32.040 --> 05:33.770
we make a trip back to Tongzhou?

05:40.320 --> 05:43.090
[Govern with Clarity from Above]

05:43.430 --> 05:45.720
That ungrateful wretch!

05:46.680 --> 05:48.940
He actually dared to rebuke me to my face!

05:49.720 --> 05:51.870
He claims I am responsible for
the 15 dike breaches

05:51.870 --> 05:53.430
along the lower Huaihe River!

05:53.430 --> 05:54.430
He's crazy.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.720
But what can those words do to you?

05:55.720 --> 05:56.920
He's threatening me.

05:58.040 --> 05:59.920
If I refuse to deal with Wang Xuanfan,

05:59.920 --> 06:01.830
he'll launch mass prosecutions
across the Huaihe River region.

06:01.830 --> 06:02.310
By then,

06:02.310 --> 06:03.570
not just Wang Xuanfan,

06:04.190 --> 06:06.870
but half the Imperial Court officials
will be dragged down with him!

06:06.870 --> 06:07.510
Master.

06:17.390 --> 06:19.720
He's in charge of the Ministry of Revenue.

06:20.390 --> 06:22.120
If he truly moves against us...

06:24.830 --> 06:26.490
there will be nothing I can do.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.270
Zhang Qi!

06:32.409 --> 06:35.950
[Wang Mansion]

06:34.520 --> 06:36.310
The Senior Grand Secretary's meaning is

06:36.310 --> 06:38.920
that you back down this time, Lord Wang—

06:39.159 --> 06:41.720
go back to your hometown
and rest for a few days.

06:41.720 --> 06:42.950
Once things blow over,

06:42.950 --> 06:44.480
you can return to your post.

06:51.680 --> 06:52.600
Since the Senior Grand Secretary

06:52.600 --> 06:53.540
has said so,

06:55.000 --> 06:56.530
this official will comply.

07:02.520 --> 07:13.710
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

07:13.940 --> 07:17.720
[Ji Mansion]

07:26.310 --> 07:27.680
Come on, be careful.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.510
So many crates.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.659
What's inside

07:37.750 --> 07:38.750
all these crates?

07:38.920 --> 07:40.159
They're archives

07:40.600 --> 07:42.159
from the Penal Court's file storeroom.

07:42.159 --> 07:44.020
But they're all from 10 years ago.

07:44.130 --> 07:46.310
At that time, the late Prince Chengqing
was plotting treason.

07:46.310 --> 07:48.190
In order to seize leverage
over court officials,

07:48.190 --> 07:49.420
he bribed the Penal Court

07:49.420 --> 07:50.120
and had the files documenting

07:50.120 --> 07:51.750
the words and deeds of the officials

07:51.750 --> 07:52.870
shipped out by boat.

07:52.870 --> 07:54.630
However, the Grand Secretariat
at that time

07:54.630 --> 07:57.190
secretly ordered canal bandits
to intercept them.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.950
I happened to be serving at
the Canal Transport Office at the time

07:58.950 --> 08:00.150
and ran into the case.

08:00.360 --> 08:02.180
But they're from 10 years ago.

08:02.310 --> 08:03.840
Can they still be of use now?

08:04.040 --> 08:04.600
They can.

08:05.830 --> 08:07.830
Every major decision a person makes

08:07.950 --> 08:09.190
leaves traces.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.240
Ten years ago,

08:17.800 --> 08:19.390
my mentor had just joined the cabinet.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.650
He was full of ambition

08:20.730 --> 08:22.790
to reform the land and save the world.

08:23.310 --> 08:23.920
Yet

08:24.310 --> 08:25.800
these same files also

08:25.800 --> 08:26.430
tell me

08:27.390 --> 08:28.590
that my mentor values

08:28.750 --> 08:30.890
practical ability over moral character

08:30.890 --> 08:32.440
in the men he uses.

08:34.100 --> 08:35.179
Why are only half

08:35.390 --> 08:36.750
of these files left?

08:37.360 --> 08:39.620
I read through my mentor's files long ago

08:39.750 --> 08:41.809
and have kept the useful ones with me.

08:42.360 --> 08:44.260
Then I suppose you have

08:44.320 --> 08:45.840
also read everything on Wang Xuanfan?

08:45.840 --> 08:47.720
I've read those
of all the important officials

08:47.720 --> 08:48.980
of the Imperial Court.

08:49.240 --> 08:51.240
Then how do you plan to investigate?

08:56.840 --> 08:57.550
For my mentor

08:57.550 --> 08:59.680
to shield Wang Xuanfan to this extent,

09:00.240 --> 09:01.390
whatever leverage Wang Xuanfan

09:01.390 --> 09:02.440
has over him

09:02.750 --> 09:03.950
must be substantial.

09:05.750 --> 09:06.880
Could it be treason?

09:07.200 --> 09:09.420
The Senior Grand Secretary
and the late Prince Chengqing

09:09.420 --> 09:11.360
colluded secretly?

09:11.670 --> 09:12.930
That's a possibility.

09:13.870 --> 09:16.030
But there's nothing
on the late Prince Chengqing here.

09:16.030 --> 09:17.890
Only the late Prince Ruichang's.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.270
Before I moved against

09:28.270 --> 09:30.130
the late Prince Ruichang's heir,

09:30.200 --> 09:32.000
I'd already studied the prince's records

09:32.000 --> 09:33.000
thoroughly.

09:33.660 --> 09:34.860
It should be this one.

09:37.910 --> 09:38.390
Here.

09:46.240 --> 09:48.970
On the third day of the ninth lunar month
in the 24th year of Jingning,

09:48.970 --> 09:51.870
Li Zhi invited the Yuyang Hermit Liu Heng

09:51.960 --> 09:54.790
to hold a memorial service
for his late mother at the mansion.

09:54.790 --> 09:56.790
Zhou Feng, Chief Secretary
to the Prince Chengqing,

09:56.790 --> 09:58.270
the Director
of the Office of Transmission,

09:58.270 --> 09:59.510
and Wang Nian'en, steward to Wang Xuanfan,

09:59.510 --> 10:00.790
were in attendance.

10:01.750 --> 10:03.150
After the banquet, Wang Nian'en

10:03.150 --> 10:05.210
presented a string of 18 amber beads,

10:05.650 --> 10:08.580
along with two baskets
each of tangerines and pears,

10:09.030 --> 10:11.120
to the residence of Fu Hailian,

10:12.550 --> 10:14.810
Grand Secretary of the Eastern Cabinet.

10:15.940 --> 10:16.760
[On the third day of the ninth lunar month
in the 24th year of Jingning,]

10:16.780 --> 10:17.800
[Li Zhi invited
the Yuyang Hermit Liu Heng]

10:16.870 --> 10:18.000
Who is this

10:17.820 --> 10:18.650
[to hold a memorial service
for his late mother in the mansion.]

10:18.150 --> 10:19.080
Yuyang Hermit?

10:29.000 --> 10:29.930
Do you know about

10:30.870 --> 10:31.930
the Chunyuan Sect?

10:54.940 --> 11:10.230
♪ The righteous are poor and short-lived ♪

11:12.900 --> 11:28.960
♪ While the wicked prosper and live long ♪

11:19.720 --> 11:20.390
Someone just

11:20.390 --> 11:21.320
threw a rock in.

11:21.750 --> 11:22.870
This was tied to it.

11:30.060 --> 11:35.350
♪ Even Heaven and Earth bow to the strong
and oppress the weak ♪

11:41.050 --> 11:42.780
You suspect it's Wang Xuanfan?

11:46.050 --> 11:47.320
Who else could it be?

11:47.750 --> 11:49.410
He's growing desperate, huh?

11:52.390 --> 11:54.170
Power stirs the heart—

11:54.510 --> 11:56.040
he cannot bear to walk away.

11:56.790 --> 11:58.360
Prime Minister, Madam,

11:59.150 --> 12:00.680
Eunuch Zhang has sent word.

12:01.360 --> 12:03.560
He said His Majesty has recalled Ye Xian

12:04.080 --> 12:05.510
and ordered him to investigate
the case of Wang Xuanfan's

12:05.510 --> 12:07.710
assassination attempt on Chen Yanyun.

12:08.150 --> 12:09.080
Prime Minister,

12:09.510 --> 12:10.680
that boy Ye Xian

12:10.840 --> 12:12.030
won't be on our side.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.510
By imperial decree,

12:32.510 --> 12:34.200
the case of the assassination attempt
on Chen Yanyun

12:34.200 --> 12:36.030
is to be tried primarily
by the Xuanfeng Guard,

12:36.030 --> 12:38.150
with the Ministry of Justice
and the Court of Judicial Review assisting.

12:38.150 --> 12:40.550
Xuanfeng Guard Commander Ye Xian
is ordered

12:40.550 --> 12:42.030
to return to the capital immediately!

12:42.030 --> 12:43.440
Be careful with everything!

12:43.440 --> 12:44.550
Pack the Master's and Madam's

12:44.550 --> 12:45.600
valuables separately.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.460
Don't damage anything valuable!

12:50.510 --> 12:51.390
Be more careful!

12:51.390 --> 12:52.080
Hurry up.

12:52.150 --> 12:53.360
-It's all your fault!
-Stop dawdling!

12:53.360 --> 12:54.080
If you hadn't insisted

12:54.080 --> 12:55.390
on going up against Chen Yanyun,

12:55.390 --> 12:57.050
it wouldn't have come to this!

13:02.030 --> 13:03.910
Say something!

13:06.000 --> 13:07.510
This clearly has nothing to do with us...

13:07.510 --> 13:08.710
Will you ever shut up?

13:08.870 --> 13:10.030
Why are you yelling at me?

13:10.030 --> 13:10.910
You only know how to blame me!

13:10.910 --> 13:11.870
As if you had no fault in this!

13:11.870 --> 13:12.720
-It's all your fault!
-Why don't you

13:12.720 --> 13:13.790
take that attitude to the court
and shout at them?

13:13.790 --> 13:14.840
What else can we do?

13:14.840 --> 13:16.840
What should we do now?

13:42.090 --> 13:47.290
[Elegant Orchids and Fragrant Angelica]

14:49.510 --> 14:50.360
How did it go?

14:53.510 --> 14:54.120
Hey!

14:54.910 --> 14:56.640
Ye Xian, what's wrong with you?

14:58.630 --> 15:00.160
So you really were injured.

15:00.510 --> 15:01.040
I'm fine.

15:01.200 --> 15:01.960
I thought he was

15:01.960 --> 15:02.960
only pretending.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.450
Ye Xian.

15:08.910 --> 15:09.840
Get to the point.

15:10.510 --> 15:11.510
How many are dead?

15:12.240 --> 15:12.840
Three.

15:13.510 --> 15:15.150
In addition to Wang Xuanfan and his wife,

15:15.150 --> 15:17.080
their steward was also found dead.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.520
Wang Nian'en?

15:21.960 --> 15:23.020
How do you know him?

15:27.270 --> 15:28.730
Let's go take a look first.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.720
Grand Secretary Wang and his wife

15:41.720 --> 15:43.320
were suffocated by coal fumes.

15:43.320 --> 15:44.270
Their steward, Wang Nian'en,

15:43.980 --> 15:52.300
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

15:44.270 --> 15:45.600
was strangled to death.

15:45.870 --> 15:46.320
There are

15:46.320 --> 15:48.790
clear signs he struggled with someone
before his death.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.150
The time of death for all three was

15:50.150 --> 15:50.870
between 1 a.m.

15:50.870 --> 15:52.440
and 5 a.m. today.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.510
Was anything found

16:02.150 --> 16:03.410
on the steward's body?

16:04.240 --> 16:05.630
My Lord, nothing escapes your eye.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.230
Look here.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.440
The steward burned charcoal,
which caused Wang Xuanfan

16:15.440 --> 16:18.010
and his wife to die
from charcoal smoke inhalation.

16:18.010 --> 16:19.610
But the person who killed him

16:20.000 --> 16:21.530
was someone else entirely.

16:22.670 --> 16:23.840
Any other findings?

16:31.310 --> 16:32.190
What's

16:33.240 --> 16:34.190
this wound here?

16:34.550 --> 16:35.460
Madam,

16:35.840 --> 16:36.790
this wound

16:37.030 --> 16:39.080
matches the deceased's own thumbnail.

16:39.080 --> 16:41.340
He likely pinched himself before dying.

16:41.600 --> 16:43.290
But he was being strangled.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.530
Why would he pinch himself so hard?

16:45.840 --> 16:46.550
And

16:46.870 --> 16:48.270
in this particular spot?

17:00.200 --> 17:01.060
I remember now.

17:02.030 --> 17:02.600
When we found

17:02.600 --> 17:03.750
the steward's body,

17:04.270 --> 17:05.800
he was sitting on the ground

17:06.030 --> 17:07.510
with his left hand posed

17:08.030 --> 17:09.630
in a rather unusual gesture.

17:09.750 --> 17:11.200
But later, after the body was moved,

17:11.200 --> 17:12.859
the hand's position changed.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.359
Do you still remember what the pose was?

17:16.109 --> 17:17.270
It was...

17:18.550 --> 17:19.160
like this.

17:26.589 --> 17:27.450
Chunyuan Sect.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.300
Chunyuan Sect?

17:34.030 --> 17:35.220
I assume you've thoroughly investigated

17:35.220 --> 17:36.220
the entire estate?

17:35.370 --> 17:40.060
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

17:38.270 --> 17:40.330
Not even a fly could have slipped out.

17:40.400 --> 17:42.110
You know something, don't you?

17:42.110 --> 17:43.440
I have some suspicions.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.750
To confirm them...

17:49.510 --> 17:51.040
we'll have to test further.

17:53.550 --> 17:55.310
First, Chen Yanyun was assassinated,

17:55.310 --> 17:56.550
and now Wang Xuanfan and his wife

17:56.300 --> 17:58.870
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

17:56.550 --> 17:58.200
have perished from charcoal smoke!

17:58.200 --> 18:00.600
And both of them were
my Grand Secretaries!

18:00.750 --> 18:02.030
I never expected
public security in the capital

18:02.030 --> 18:03.400
to deteriorate to this extent!

18:03.400 --> 18:04.200
Your Majesty,

18:04.550 --> 18:07.110
this case is not a matter of
public security.

18:07.310 --> 18:08.640
Please explain, Mr. Fu.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.110
Wang Xuanfan

18:10.720 --> 18:11.880
served

18:12.110 --> 18:13.930
as my strategist for years,

18:14.160 --> 18:14.920
and Jiuheng

18:15.830 --> 18:17.310
is my disciple.

18:18.200 --> 18:19.400
Others have

18:19.720 --> 18:21.400
many suspicions about this case,

18:21.400 --> 18:23.070
yet none dare to
investigate it too closely.

18:23.070 --> 18:24.110
So let me

18:25.030 --> 18:26.830
inquire about this personally.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.070
Lord Wang.

18:38.870 --> 18:42.380
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

18:41.480 --> 18:42.870
Yes, Senior Grand Secretary Fu.

18:42.870 --> 18:45.620
The Court of Judicial Review
previously found

18:45.750 --> 18:47.310
that Wang Xuanfan had his man

18:47.310 --> 18:48.790
tailing Chen Jiuheng.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.340
Is that true?

18:50.480 --> 18:51.640
It is true.

18:52.830 --> 18:54.090
The man confessed

18:54.310 --> 18:56.650
that Wang Xuanfan feared Chen Yanyun

18:56.720 --> 18:57.480
might expose

18:57.480 --> 18:59.270
his past dealings with Prince Chengqing.

18:59.270 --> 19:01.200
So Wang Xuanfan ordered him
to keep a close watch on Chen Yanyun

19:01.200 --> 19:02.200
and report

19:02.310 --> 19:03.320
his every move.

19:04.110 --> 19:06.510
Did you question
Wang Xuanfan directly yourself?

19:06.510 --> 19:07.970
Wang Xuanfan was insolent

19:08.030 --> 19:09.230
and refused to see me.

19:09.680 --> 19:10.920
If you have a conclusion, Mr. Fu,

19:10.920 --> 19:12.120
please speak freely.

19:12.510 --> 19:13.510
In my opinion,

19:14.310 --> 19:16.880
both the assassination attempt
on Chen Jiuheng

19:16.880 --> 19:18.720
and Wang Xuanfan's death

19:18.880 --> 19:21.440
are in fact part of the same case.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.640
If Wang Xuanfan

19:24.240 --> 19:25.880
was the sole mastermind

19:25.880 --> 19:27.680
capable of orchestrating
the attempt on Chen Jiuheng,

19:27.680 --> 19:28.350
then...

19:30.030 --> 19:32.760
among those who could've
poisoned Wang Xuanfan,

19:32.920 --> 19:34.120
Chen Jiuheng himself

19:35.510 --> 19:36.880
is the most suspicious.

19:39.920 --> 19:40.720
Well...

19:41.510 --> 19:42.410
I think so too.

19:42.490 --> 19:43.790
I really didn't expect this.

19:43.790 --> 19:44.310
Indeed.

19:45.070 --> 19:46.230
In my opinion,

19:46.090 --> 19:49.390
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

19:46.510 --> 19:47.980
For any ordinary person,

19:48.110 --> 19:49.640
poisoning Wang Xuanfan

19:49.790 --> 19:51.830
would be impossible to accomplish.

19:51.880 --> 19:54.100
But Chen Yanyun holds a high position,

19:54.180 --> 19:55.880
is well-versed in underworld methods,

19:55.880 --> 19:57.480
and has martial arts skills.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.050
If he was the one behind it,

19:59.110 --> 20:01.140
then I believe it's very likely.

20:01.350 --> 20:03.550
This case is of the most serious nature.

20:03.750 --> 20:05.270
This official implores Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly,

20:05.270 --> 20:06.960
bring the murderer to justice,

20:06.960 --> 20:08.960
and punish him according to the law.

20:15.040 --> 20:18.550
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

20:15.070 --> 20:17.830
This official implores Your Majesty to
investigate thoroughly,

20:17.830 --> 20:20.400
bring the murderer to justice,

20:20.400 --> 20:22.070
and punish him according to the law!

20:22.070 --> 20:22.590
I...

20:22.830 --> 20:23.630
Your Majesty,

20:23.920 --> 20:24.830
in my opinion,

20:25.310 --> 20:27.200
Chen Jiuheng should be
placed under suspicion

20:27.200 --> 20:28.790
and detained by the relevant authorities

20:28.790 --> 20:31.240
to restore proper order in the court.

20:35.110 --> 20:39.580
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

21:22.790 --> 21:24.880
Chen Yanyun arrives!

21:39.790 --> 21:42.700
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

21:49.590 --> 21:50.320
This subject

21:50.920 --> 21:53.250
kneels to pay my respects to Your Majesty.

21:53.550 --> 21:54.440
Rise, Mr. Chen.

21:56.960 --> 21:58.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:59.350 --> 22:00.160
Why

22:00.400 --> 22:02.030
aren't you recovering at home

22:02.030 --> 22:03.560
instead of coming to court?

22:04.110 --> 22:04.910
Your Majesty,

22:06.310 --> 22:07.400
I heard

22:08.510 --> 22:10.680
that Wang Xuanfan
and his wife died tragically,

22:10.680 --> 22:11.510
so I thought

22:12.030 --> 22:13.360
it best to attend court.

22:14.030 --> 22:14.830
Otherwise,

22:15.310 --> 22:16.070
I feared

22:16.920 --> 22:18.750
I might become the target of accusations

22:18.750 --> 22:20.550
and end up being wrongly blamed.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.260
What does he mean by that?

22:25.440 --> 22:26.970
What is the meaning of this?

22:28.880 --> 22:30.750
Lord Chen, don't tar

22:30.750 --> 22:33.360
all the officials here
with the same brush.

22:34.000 --> 22:36.000
I have one thing I don't understand.

22:36.790 --> 22:38.830
Lord Chen, I heard you

22:38.830 --> 22:40.160
were severely injured.

22:40.310 --> 22:41.710
How come you look

22:41.830 --> 22:43.230
quite healthy right now?

22:44.640 --> 22:45.750
Lord Su, you came to my manor
a few days ago

22:45.750 --> 22:46.880
to visit me

22:47.030 --> 22:47.760
and even said

22:48.110 --> 22:49.970
you'd burn incense day and night,

22:50.640 --> 22:52.370
praying for my swift recovery.

22:53.110 --> 22:53.840
What?

22:53.880 --> 22:56.010
Now that I'm finally somewhat better,

22:56.070 --> 22:57.670
you're displeased instead?

22:58.270 --> 23:00.440
I am just raising reasonable doubts.

23:01.100 --> 23:03.300
Why must you be so sarcastic, Lord Chen?

23:04.070 --> 23:04.920
Doubts?

23:05.310 --> 23:07.840
Are you doubting
the Senior Grand Secretary?

23:08.310 --> 23:09.310
Senior Grand Secretary,

23:09.310 --> 23:10.790
didn't you bring an imperial physician

23:10.790 --> 23:12.200
when you visited me
at my manor a few days ago?

23:12.200 --> 23:13.640
So, Lord Su,

23:13.640 --> 23:14.790
are you doubting that physician

23:14.790 --> 23:16.000
or the Senior Grand Secretary himself?

23:16.000 --> 23:17.000
Well... I...

23:17.000 --> 23:18.000
Alright, enough.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.510
Let's stick to the matter at hand.

23:19.510 --> 23:21.370
Stop this pointless squabbling.

23:24.720 --> 23:25.510
Jiuheng.

23:27.270 --> 23:29.670
Wang Xuanfan and his wife died tragically,

23:29.920 --> 23:30.720
and you

23:31.200 --> 23:32.400
are under suspicion.

23:32.790 --> 23:34.440
So for now, you'll remain in custody

23:34.440 --> 23:35.640
under investigation

23:35.830 --> 23:37.630
by the Three Judiciary Offices.

23:38.200 --> 23:39.140
Mentor,

23:39.350 --> 23:40.750
why?

23:41.110 --> 23:43.310
Just the other day, you told me yourself

23:43.790 --> 23:44.810
that there was

23:45.030 --> 23:46.350
no solid evidence

23:46.350 --> 23:47.510
of Wang Xuanfan's collusion

23:47.510 --> 23:48.880
with the late Prince Chengqing.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.400
So I advised you to let it go

23:50.640 --> 23:52.470
and not pursue it out of spite.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.320
You said nothing at the time.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.750
And then last night, Wang Xuanfan

23:55.750 --> 23:57.590
died tragically in his residence.

23:57.590 --> 23:58.920
Can you truly say...

24:01.400 --> 24:02.110
his death

24:03.400 --> 24:04.880
has nothing to do with you?

24:14.000 --> 24:14.640
Mentor,

24:15.720 --> 24:18.450
I am truly being wronged.

24:18.790 --> 24:20.190
I stayed silent back then

24:20.350 --> 24:22.070
because my heart was full of bitterness

24:22.070 --> 24:23.800
I couldn't express.

24:25.880 --> 24:28.210
What bitterness could you possibly feel?

24:31.110 --> 24:32.240
I don't understand.

24:32.790 --> 24:33.880
I'd already

24:34.110 --> 24:34.880
brought the matter of Wang Xuanfan's

24:34.880 --> 24:36.070
embezzlement of the river repair funds

24:36.070 --> 24:37.130
to your attention.

24:37.920 --> 24:38.910
Why did you

24:38.930 --> 24:40.590
still shield him at all costs?

24:52.200 --> 24:53.140
It seems

24:53.170 --> 24:55.400
Wang Xuanfan was
telling the truth after all.

24:55.400 --> 24:57.280
What did he say?

24:57.830 --> 24:59.510
After the disaster relief grain case,

24:59.510 --> 25:01.240
I had a drink with Wang Xuanfan.

25:01.550 --> 25:02.700
He said

25:02.720 --> 25:04.760
that he had done far more for you

25:04.960 --> 25:06.610
than I ever had.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.360
And he said the scheme

25:08.430 --> 25:09.350
to substitute bran

25:09.350 --> 25:10.610
for grain was your idea

25:10.930 --> 25:11.960
in order to

25:12.160 --> 25:13.830
bring down Fan Chuan.

25:16.780 --> 25:17.510
In the end,

25:18.350 --> 25:21.350
Wang Xuanfan took kickbacks
from the grain merchants

25:21.510 --> 25:23.400
but was later thrown into
imperial prison by you.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.110
However,

25:24.510 --> 25:26.310
the kickbacks Wang Xuanfan took

25:26.440 --> 25:28.700
were actually collected on your behalf.

25:30.750 --> 25:33.240
Baseless drunken talk,

25:33.550 --> 25:36.030
and you dare raise them before the Court?

25:36.030 --> 25:38.490
You've grown increasingly muddle-headed!

25:40.400 --> 25:42.240
If drunken words are baseless,

25:42.840 --> 25:43.730
then Mentor,

25:44.270 --> 25:45.760
inferring I am a suspect based on

25:45.760 --> 25:47.220
a past grudge—

25:47.960 --> 25:49.960
isn't that just as baseless?

25:50.440 --> 25:52.800
This is utter sophistry!

25:58.790 --> 26:01.520
Where is the head of
the Court of Judicial Review?

26:01.590 --> 26:03.520
I'm here, Senior Grand Secretary.

26:04.680 --> 26:06.480
Head of the Ministry of Justice?

26:09.920 --> 26:11.580
Yes, Senior Grand Secretary.

26:11.750 --> 26:13.010
Head of the Censorate?

26:16.640 --> 26:17.720
Yes, Senior Grand Secretary.

26:17.720 --> 26:18.680
The Court of Judicial Review shall

26:18.680 --> 26:20.680
preside over the Wang Xuanfan case,

26:20.720 --> 26:23.310
with the Ministry of Justice
and the Censorate assisting!

26:23.310 --> 26:24.440
Chen Yanyun

26:25.110 --> 26:26.570
is under grave suspicion!

26:33.920 --> 26:34.680
Report!

26:35.200 --> 26:38.330
Xuanfeng Guard Commander Ye Xian
requests an audience!

26:43.160 --> 26:45.340
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

26:46.240 --> 26:47.040
Your Majesty,

26:47.440 --> 26:48.000
I had

26:48.000 --> 26:49.720
Wang Xuanfan's residence sealed off

26:49.720 --> 26:51.510
and everyone inside
thoroughly investigated.

26:51.510 --> 26:53.170
And we made a major discovery.

26:54.510 --> 26:55.400
What discovery?

26:55.400 --> 26:56.460
Present it at once.

27:28.640 --> 27:29.440
Your Majesty.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.920
Hasn't the court been dismissed?

28:12.200 --> 28:13.930
Why hasn't Yanyun come out yet?

28:18.950 --> 28:22.110
[Fearless]

28:22.030 --> 28:24.350
This is a sign of the Chunyuan Sect?

28:25.070 --> 28:25.880
Your Majesty,

28:26.200 --> 28:28.400
the Chunyuan Sect makes use of
various signs.

28:28.400 --> 28:30.000
This one is called Fearless—

28:30.030 --> 28:31.510
it signifies a willingness
to die for the cause

28:31.510 --> 28:33.500
and press forward without hesitation.

28:33.500 --> 28:37.100
[Fearless]

28:33.680 --> 28:35.030
On the back of
the Wang household's steward,

28:35.030 --> 28:36.240
I found this mark.

28:38.830 --> 28:40.350
But as I recall,

28:40.680 --> 28:42.200
the Chunyuan Sect

28:42.200 --> 28:43.930
was completely eradicated

28:44.680 --> 28:45.610
when they failed

28:46.030 --> 28:47.680
in their rebellion alongside Prince Chengqing.

28:47.680 --> 28:48.480
Your Majesty,

28:49.400 --> 28:50.270
back then,

28:50.920 --> 28:52.920
only the majority were eliminated.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.070
Some

28:54.750 --> 28:56.160
fled to Beiman

28:56.680 --> 28:59.340
and were taken into service
by the Beiman court.

28:59.590 --> 29:00.850
There was such a thing?

29:01.550 --> 29:02.160
What use would

29:02.160 --> 29:03.480
the remnants of the Chunyuan Sect
be to Beiman?

29:03.370 --> 29:07.100
[Honor and Illumination]

29:03.830 --> 29:05.020
That was because

29:05.350 --> 29:07.070
among those remnants

29:07.350 --> 29:08.680
who fled to Beiman,

29:09.510 --> 29:10.610
some actually

29:10.750 --> 29:12.810
held official titles in our country.

29:13.310 --> 29:13.970
Therefore,

29:14.310 --> 29:15.720
the Beiman Imperial Court

29:15.720 --> 29:17.720
took them in as scholars and advisors,

29:17.720 --> 29:19.720
granting them official positions.

29:21.070 --> 29:22.680
Then why would Wang Xuanfan

29:22.680 --> 29:23.510
employ

29:23.510 --> 29:25.270
a Chunyuan Sect member as his steward?

29:25.270 --> 29:26.070
Your Majesty,

29:27.070 --> 29:28.470
though the Chunyuan Sect

29:28.550 --> 29:30.000
once wielded great influence,

29:30.000 --> 29:32.110
most of them were killed by me after all.

29:32.110 --> 29:33.310
Those surfacing now

29:33.310 --> 29:34.160
are merely

29:34.350 --> 29:36.550
hidden remnants.

29:36.830 --> 29:38.630
They can't stir up much trouble.

29:38.750 --> 29:39.440
I think

29:40.000 --> 29:41.510
we should have the Three Judiciary Offices

29:41.510 --> 29:42.920
investigate carefully

29:43.400 --> 29:45.330
while maintaining strict secrecy

29:45.590 --> 29:46.440
to prevent

29:46.750 --> 29:48.030
rumors from spreading

29:48.240 --> 29:49.770
and misleading the public.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.200
You're right, Mr. Fu.

29:55.590 --> 29:56.350
Then...

29:57.640 --> 29:59.500
are we still arresting Lord Chen?

30:12.870 --> 30:16.270
[Honor and Illumination]

30:17.400 --> 30:18.860
It's better to let Jiuheng

30:19.550 --> 30:20.960
return home to recover.

30:22.000 --> 30:22.800
Your Majesty,

30:23.830 --> 30:26.510
there's still work
in the Hall of Literary Profundity.

30:26.510 --> 30:27.560
I shall take my leave.

30:27.560 --> 30:31.020
[Honor and Illumination]

30:28.790 --> 30:29.310
I...

30:38.060 --> 30:40.890
[Fu Mansion]

30:57.350 --> 30:58.480
What's wrong, dear?

30:58.790 --> 30:59.920
Wang Xuanfan's steward

30:59.920 --> 31:00.750
had the Fearless mark

31:00.750 --> 31:02.440
tattooed on his back.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.350
Did you know about that?

31:08.400 --> 31:09.270
Who said so?

31:10.070 --> 31:11.300
Ye Xian found it.

31:12.400 --> 31:13.530
That's impossible.

31:14.190 --> 31:15.790
Followers of the Chunyuan Sect believe in

31:15.790 --> 31:17.510
"coming pure and leaving untainted."

31:17.510 --> 31:19.510
Even for the sake of
their parents or relatives,

31:19.510 --> 31:21.570
they would never harm their own body,

31:21.750 --> 31:23.160
let alone have the Fearless mark

31:23.160 --> 31:24.560
tattooed on themselves.

31:36.030 --> 31:37.490
Could it have been forged?

31:41.070 --> 31:41.720
Oh no.

31:43.030 --> 31:44.430
We've fallen into a trap.

31:45.590 --> 31:46.200
Ye Xian!

31:49.590 --> 31:50.070
My Lord.

31:54.030 --> 31:55.090
You must be hungry.

31:55.160 --> 31:56.000
Here're some meat pies.

31:56.000 --> 31:57.530
Eat them while they're hot.

31:58.880 --> 31:59.740
I'm not hungry.

32:00.640 --> 32:03.310
His Majesty has ordered me
to remain in the palace overnight.

32:03.310 --> 32:04.710
You should all head back.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.730
His Majesty is keeping you?

32:07.000 --> 32:07.830
You could've just sent anyone

32:07.830 --> 32:09.110
out to say so,

32:09.590 --> 32:11.320
yet you made the trip yourself.

32:12.880 --> 32:15.210
Were you worried I'd get anxious waiting?

32:17.350 --> 32:18.160
I came...

32:19.030 --> 32:20.360
to let Li Xianhuai know.

32:22.310 --> 32:24.200
Yes. Yes.

32:27.110 --> 32:28.300
Look at you.

32:28.680 --> 32:31.340
Why do you always say one thing
and mean another?

32:32.000 --> 32:32.800
Third Master!

32:34.110 --> 32:34.870
You're out.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.240
How did it go?

32:38.350 --> 32:39.080
Don't worry.

32:39.790 --> 32:40.720
Why are you here?

32:41.160 --> 32:42.590
I couldn't be at ease waiting alone

32:42.590 --> 32:43.480
at home.

32:43.640 --> 32:45.070
He's so full of schemes—

32:45.640 --> 32:47.500
what's there to be worried about?

32:47.680 --> 32:48.310
Ye Xian,

32:49.110 --> 32:50.300
do you always

32:50.350 --> 32:51.610
have to talk like that?

32:53.240 --> 32:54.200
If you two find him unpleasant,

32:54.200 --> 32:55.330
then stop using him.

32:57.590 --> 32:59.000
What's this got to do with you?

32:59.000 --> 32:59.720
Am I wrong?

33:00.240 --> 33:01.400
With the mess between them,

33:01.400 --> 33:03.530
when have you not been dragged into it?

33:07.920 --> 33:08.970
And you two—

33:09.350 --> 33:10.240
you're already married.

33:10.240 --> 33:12.040
Can you just leave Ye Xian alone?

33:15.350 --> 33:16.150
Let's go home.

33:25.110 --> 33:25.640
See?

33:26.000 --> 33:27.860
Those two are struck speechless.

33:34.550 --> 33:35.240
Ruixiang,

33:36.200 --> 33:37.310
tell me, why do I find

33:37.310 --> 33:39.310
that manner of his so irresistible?

33:39.880 --> 33:42.680
You simply know a good man
when you see one, My Lady.

33:51.320 --> 33:54.500
[Audience with His Majesty at Ji's Silk Shop
at 9 AM the day after tomorrow]

33:54.310 --> 33:55.070
What is this?

33:56.720 --> 33:57.720
It's from Ye Xian.

33:58.020 --> 33:59.060
He's asking us

33:59.510 --> 34:00.440
to meet His Majesty
the day after tomorrow.

33:59.900 --> 34:01.740
[Audience with His Majesty at Ji's Silk Shop
at 9 AM the day after tomorrow]

34:03.660 --> 34:06.610
[Ji's Silk Shop]

34:06.740 --> 34:08.360
-Your subject
-Your subject's wife

34:08.360 --> 34:11.440
-kowtow before Your Majesty.
-kowtow before Your Majesty.

34:11.440 --> 34:12.170
Please rise.

34:14.030 --> 34:15.030
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:15.030 --> 34:16.429
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:20.190 --> 34:21.920
Gu Jinzhao, we meet again.

34:22.440 --> 34:23.960
You really are remarkable.

34:23.960 --> 34:25.230
You actually managed to

34:25.230 --> 34:25.960
make

34:26.110 --> 34:28.239
both Mr. Chen and Mr. Ye fight over you.

34:32.110 --> 34:32.909
Your Majesty,

34:33.150 --> 34:34.400
your life is precious.

34:34.400 --> 34:36.190
How can you go about
in disguise like this?

34:36.190 --> 34:37.590
This place is crowded with
all sorts of people.

34:37.590 --> 34:39.630
You should return to the palace at once.

34:39.630 --> 34:41.360
For once, Lord Chen makes a fair point.

34:41.360 --> 34:43.320
This subject will escort
Your Majesty back at once.

34:43.320 --> 34:44.030
Come on.

34:44.510 --> 34:45.190
It wasn't easy for me

34:45.190 --> 34:47.550
to get the Empress Dowager's permission
to leave the palace.

34:47.550 --> 34:48.800
I-I won't bring up the matter
between the three of you anymore,

34:48.800 --> 34:49.400
alright?

34:50.030 --> 34:50.670
Really.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.730
I promise I won't mention it again.

34:54.590 --> 34:55.679
You two may leave.

34:55.800 --> 34:57.730
I have something to say to Mr. Chen.

34:58.440 --> 35:00.550
This time,
thanks to Your Majesty's assistance

35:00.550 --> 35:02.320
in recalling Commander Ye in time,

35:02.320 --> 35:04.320
I was able to force my mentor
to back down.

35:04.320 --> 35:05.850
No need for such formality.

35:06.280 --> 35:08.000
It is I who should thank you.

35:08.190 --> 35:09.360
If it weren't for you

35:09.360 --> 35:10.360
discovering that Wang Xuanfan's

35:10.360 --> 35:12.150
steward, a Chunyuan remnant,

35:12.800 --> 35:13.690
was actually recommended to him

35:13.690 --> 35:14.860
by Mr. Fu,

35:16.030 --> 35:17.560
I would never have imagined

35:17.670 --> 35:19.190
that my Senior Grand Secretary

35:19.190 --> 35:21.070
would be involved with Chunyuan remnants.

35:21.070 --> 35:22.030
There might be

35:22.510 --> 35:23.510
more to this.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.980
No need to speak up for Mr. Fu.

35:26.110 --> 35:28.030
With Mr. Fu's intelligence and means,

35:28.030 --> 35:28.760
could he

35:28.760 --> 35:29.510
really have just recommended

35:29.510 --> 35:31.040
someone of unknown origin?

35:31.420 --> 35:32.360
I'm telling you,

35:33.030 --> 35:33.840
Mr. Fu

35:34.110 --> 35:34.960
must have known perfectly well

35:34.960 --> 35:36.350
about Wang Nian'en's

35:36.510 --> 35:37.910
background and origins.

35:40.710 --> 35:41.670
In truth,

35:41.960 --> 35:43.960
Mr. Fu has rendered meritorious service
to the state,

35:43.960 --> 35:46.590
and I've always
kept his contributions in mind.

35:46.590 --> 35:48.230
But he has gone too far—

35:48.590 --> 35:49.670
deceiving his sovereign

35:49.670 --> 35:50.760
and abusing his power to corrupt politics.

35:50.760 --> 35:51.800
He must understand

35:51.800 --> 35:53.000
that this empire
belongs to my family alone,

35:53.000 --> 35:53.710
not to him!

35:54.280 --> 35:55.030
Now,

35:55.030 --> 35:56.150
he's even entangled with

35:56.150 --> 35:57.280
Chunyuan remnants.

35:57.710 --> 35:58.370
Perhaps

35:58.630 --> 36:01.290
he's been plotting
an even greater conspiracy.

36:01.510 --> 36:02.310
Fortunately,

36:02.900 --> 36:04.760
I still have you and Mr. Ye,

36:04.800 --> 36:05.800
both ready to risk everything

36:05.800 --> 36:06.400
to help me.

36:08.670 --> 36:11.070
This subject dares not accept such praise.

36:11.440 --> 36:12.770
As for Ye Xian's merits,

36:12.960 --> 36:14.920
I can't reward him further right now.

36:14.920 --> 36:17.710
It'll have to wait
until I've assumed direct rule.

36:17.710 --> 36:18.840
As for you, Mr. Chen,

36:19.360 --> 36:21.360
I've already spoken with my mother.

36:21.840 --> 36:24.150
You are to be promoted to Grand Secretary
of the Hall of Developmental Extreme.

36:24.150 --> 36:24.710
Your Majesty...

36:24.710 --> 36:25.910
My mother has agreed.

36:26.280 --> 36:27.590
With her bringing it up,

36:27.590 --> 36:29.120
Mr. Fu likely won't refuse.

36:31.920 --> 36:32.920
Then this subject

36:33.880 --> 36:36.590
thanks Your Majesty
and Her Majesty the Empress Dowager.

36:36.590 --> 36:38.650
Then rest well and recover, Mr. Chen.

36:38.840 --> 36:41.110
I long for the day you fully recover

36:41.630 --> 36:42.880
so you can return to
the Hall of Literary Profundity

36:42.880 --> 36:45.410
and stand as an equal counterweight
to Mr. Fu.

36:45.880 --> 36:47.610
This subject obeys the decree.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.200
I truly didn't expect

36:50.280 --> 36:53.610
His Majesty to take the initiative
to ally himself with you.

37:00.630 --> 37:02.230
Without His Majesty's help,

37:02.600 --> 37:03.320
I would've had to

37:03.320 --> 37:05.320
bide my time for at least a few more years

37:05.320 --> 37:07.280
before daring to stand against Mentor.

37:07.280 --> 37:08.710
And without Ye Xian and me

37:08.710 --> 37:09.760
acting as vanguard,

37:09.760 --> 37:11.360
His Majesty would've had no chance either.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.360
We can only say...

37:14.190 --> 37:15.390
the timing was right.

37:17.960 --> 37:19.690
However, our young emperor...

37:21.440 --> 37:22.640
has grown quite fast.

37:23.590 --> 37:24.650
Let's wait and see.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.510
Do you think

37:27.710 --> 37:30.110
the Senior Grand Secretary will figure out

37:30.630 --> 37:32.630
that the mark on that steward's back

37:32.630 --> 37:34.030
was forged on your orders

37:34.150 --> 37:35.130
by Ye Xian?

37:35.280 --> 37:35.940
Hard to say.

37:38.030 --> 37:39.760
But whether he figures that out or not,

37:39.760 --> 37:40.820
between him and me,

37:40.920 --> 37:41.360
there is no longer

37:41.360 --> 37:43.320
any possibility of reconciliation.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.510
But if

37:45.150 --> 37:46.800
those remnants of the Chunyuan Sect

37:46.800 --> 37:49.260
are truly
the Senior Grand Secretary's men,

37:49.800 --> 37:51.550
he definitely won't let you off.

37:51.550 --> 37:52.950
And that is precisely why

37:53.630 --> 37:54.890
I must, no matter what,

37:55.280 --> 37:56.400
confront him openly

37:56.400 --> 37:58.070
in the Imperial Court.

37:59.070 --> 38:00.030
It's better to bring our conflict

38:00.030 --> 38:01.030
out into the open.

38:01.590 --> 38:02.850
That's far better than

38:03.230 --> 38:05.110
him hiding behind the sanctity
of our mentor-disciple bond

38:05.110 --> 38:07.240
while scheming against me in the dark.

38:08.960 --> 38:10.280
The only trouble is

38:11.280 --> 38:13.230
that all my men
are being closely watched by him

38:13.230 --> 38:14.430
and can't make a move.

38:15.670 --> 38:16.510
I plan

38:16.960 --> 38:19.000
to send Qingpu to Shanxi.

38:21.510 --> 38:22.800
Aren't most of the Chunyuan remnants

38:22.800 --> 38:24.190
in Beiman?

38:25.000 --> 38:26.670
Beiman borders Shanxi,

38:27.320 --> 38:28.550
and I've long since

38:28.550 --> 38:30.590
established a lot of businesses there.

38:30.590 --> 38:31.360
On the surface,

38:31.360 --> 38:32.190
it'll appear that Qingpu

38:32.190 --> 38:33.800
is going there to manage my business.

38:33.800 --> 38:34.600
But secretly,

38:34.880 --> 38:35.880
she'll be investigating

38:35.880 --> 38:37.880
clues about the Chunyuan remnants.

38:37.920 --> 38:38.510
Moreover,

38:38.510 --> 38:39.770
her martial skills are

38:39.830 --> 38:41.230
more than sufficient to protect herself.

38:41.230 --> 38:42.230
What do you think?

38:42.360 --> 38:44.020
That's actually a sound plan.

38:46.680 --> 38:49.000
[Spring Over Jade-Worn Stones]

38:49.600 --> 38:51.110
[To My Lady]

38:51.840 --> 38:53.500
Zhao, take your time and read.

38:53.630 --> 38:54.440
I'll go out first.

38:54.440 --> 38:55.000
Okay.

39:02.510 --> 39:03.590
I've attended

39:03.590 --> 39:05.280
the Shicheng border market twice now

39:05.280 --> 39:06.900
and noticed a Beiman merchant

39:06.900 --> 39:08.550
with an interpreter from our state

39:08.550 --> 39:10.080
acting very suspiciously.

39:10.320 --> 39:11.550
He burns incense every day,

39:11.550 --> 39:13.030
but when asked which deity he worships,

39:13.030 --> 39:14.160
he becomes evasive.

39:14.590 --> 39:16.000
I followed your instructions

39:16.000 --> 39:17.600
and didn't dare to alert him.

39:26.230 --> 39:27.440
Wang Nian'en was

39:27.440 --> 39:29.510
introduced to Wang Xuanfan by Fu Hailian

39:29.510 --> 39:31.370
when he first came to the capital.

39:31.510 --> 39:32.320
I followed this clue

39:32.320 --> 39:33.400
all the way down,

39:34.360 --> 39:36.030
but unfortunately, I've still

39:36.030 --> 39:37.230
found nothing so far.

39:37.440 --> 39:38.510
The Chunyuan Sect is quite active

39:38.510 --> 39:39.510
in the capital.

39:40.000 --> 39:41.510
They don't act in secret.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.630
If Wang Nian'en were just

39:43.630 --> 39:45.430
an ordinary Chunyuan follower,

39:45.920 --> 39:46.510
how could he possibly have

39:46.510 --> 39:48.070
withstood
the Xuanfeng Guard's investigation?

39:48.070 --> 39:50.000
Clues would've surfaced long ago.

39:50.190 --> 39:51.280
And how could there

39:51.280 --> 39:52.680
truly be nothing to find?

39:53.150 --> 39:54.360
You mean

39:54.960 --> 39:56.590
someone has been covering for him?

39:56.590 --> 39:58.450
But Wang Xuanfan is already dead.

39:59.150 --> 40:00.410
Could it be Fu Hailian?

40:01.110 --> 40:02.510
That remains uncertain.

40:04.320 --> 40:05.360
But you've long

40:05.630 --> 40:07.960
suspected him in your heart, haven't you?

40:08.110 --> 40:08.960
I knew it.

40:09.230 --> 40:10.760
As shrewd as Fu Hailian is,

40:11.190 --> 40:11.880
how could he place someone

40:11.880 --> 40:13.140
of unknown background

40:13.190 --> 40:14.850
in Wang Xuanfan's household?

40:16.030 --> 40:16.960
He must have known all along

40:16.960 --> 40:19.290
that Wang Nian'en was a Chunyuan remnant.

40:19.300 --> 40:20.280
But then again,

40:20.590 --> 40:21.710
since he knew all along that Wang Nian'en

40:21.710 --> 40:22.840
was a remnant of the Chunyuan Sect,

40:22.840 --> 40:23.920
why did he place him

40:23.920 --> 40:25.030
in Wang Xuanfan's household

40:25.030 --> 40:26.030
for so many years?

40:26.630 --> 40:27.670
Looks like Fu Hailian

40:27.670 --> 40:29.280
is deeply tied to the Chunyuan Sect.

40:29.280 --> 40:30.810
It's all just speculation.

40:30.960 --> 40:32.630
There is no solid evidence yet.

40:32.630 --> 40:34.440
All my men are being watched closely
by my mentor,

40:34.440 --> 40:36.370
and I dare not startle them either.

40:36.670 --> 40:37.870
I can only rely on you.

40:40.400 --> 40:43.260
Is this the first time you've ever asked me for help?

40:43.960 --> 40:44.920
Did I?

40:45.630 --> 40:48.430
You don't have to investigate
if you don't want to.

40:50.360 --> 40:51.160
You know what?

40:51.660 --> 40:53.920
The person I want to investigate the most

40:54.320 --> 40:55.250
is actually you.

40:57.400 --> 40:58.710
You know far too much.

40:59.110 --> 41:00.360
The mark of Rebirth

41:00.670 --> 41:01.870
or the Fearless mark—

41:02.070 --> 41:03.400
how do you know all this?

41:04.000 --> 41:05.330
And why would I not know?

41:05.880 --> 41:06.800
Your Lordship,

41:07.670 --> 41:09.670
you should read more in your spare time.

41:09.670 --> 41:10.920
So I think

41:11.960 --> 41:13.840
you might be a Chunyuan remnant yourself.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.490
You can go ahead

41:15.840 --> 41:17.040
and follow that lead.

41:19.030 --> 41:20.490
You think I wouldn't dare?

41:31.760 --> 41:33.320
His Majesty has asked me to tell you

41:33.320 --> 41:35.000
that He Wenxin
has taken bereavement leave.

41:35.000 --> 41:36.550
Fu Hailian has attributed
the Wang Xuanfan case

41:36.550 --> 41:38.610
to the schemes of Chunyuan remnants.

41:40.000 --> 41:42.110
And the assassination attempt against you.

41:42.110 --> 41:42.920
It's been pinned on

41:42.920 --> 41:43.920
Wang Xuanfan too.

41:44.630 --> 41:45.710
Wang Xuanfan truly

41:46.000 --> 41:46.510
was cursed

41:46.510 --> 41:48.240
to have crossed paths with you.

41:50.440 --> 41:51.240
Third Master,

41:51.840 --> 41:53.700
someone from the palace has come.

41:55.230 --> 41:55.880
It seems the decree promoting you

41:55.880 --> 41:57.510
to the Hall of Developmental Extreme
Grand Secretary

41:57.510 --> 41:58.240
has arrived.

41:58.550 --> 41:59.610
Congratulations.

41:59.840 --> 42:00.880
His Majesty is counting on you

42:00.880 --> 42:02.630
to stand against your mentor, Fu Hailian,

42:02.630 --> 42:03.710
as his equal.

42:07.880 --> 42:09.480
Reward or punishment alike,

42:09.550 --> 42:11.080
all is the Emperor's grace.

42:11.840 --> 42:14.760
By the mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

42:15.070 --> 42:16.770
Hall of Literary Profundity
Grand Secretary,

42:16.770 --> 42:19.230
Left Vice Minister of Revenue,
Chen Yanyun,

42:19.230 --> 42:20.630
is well-versed
in the classics and history,

42:20.630 --> 42:22.110
practiced in statecraft,

42:22.230 --> 42:23.630
resolute in saving the times,

42:23.630 --> 42:25.310
and gifted in aiding governance.

42:23.650 --> 42:25.950
[Imperial Edict]

42:25.360 --> 42:28.320
He's hereby promoted to Grand Secretary
of the Hall of Developmental Extreme

42:28.320 --> 42:30.710
and granted the title of
Junior Preceptor of the Heir Apparent.

42:30.710 --> 42:32.030
Thus it is decreed!

42:32.840 --> 42:35.640
This subject receives
the decree with gratitude.

42:35.840 --> 42:39.230
Long live Your Majesty.

42:41.080 --> 42:44.930
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

42:41.550 --> 42:44.000
Currently, the Fujian Maritime Trade Office,

42:44.000 --> 42:45.320
Longjiang Shipyard,

42:45.840 --> 42:47.630
and Songjiang Silk Weaving Bureau

42:47.630 --> 42:49.360
all urgently require funding.

42:49.920 --> 42:51.400
After deliberation
with the Ministry of Revenue,

42:51.400 --> 42:52.880
I propose reducing next year's

42:52.880 --> 42:54.320
military expenditure
for the Nine Border Garrisons

42:54.320 --> 42:55.280
by 30 percent

42:55.800 --> 42:57.570
to support the economy.

42:59.190 --> 43:02.320
Since this matter has already been
deliberated by the Grand Secretariat,

43:02.320 --> 43:03.320
I will...

43:03.320 --> 43:04.120
Your Majesty,

43:04.320 --> 43:06.190
this subject objects.

43:11.610 --> 43:14.150
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

43:16.700 --> 43:19.760
[Chen Mansion]

43:20.190 --> 43:22.070
Despite opposition, my mentor still

43:22.070 --> 43:23.670
strongly advocates reducing border troops

43:23.670 --> 43:25.000
and cutting military expenditure.

43:25.000 --> 43:25.880
But our state

43:26.230 --> 43:27.280
has fought Beiman

43:27.710 --> 43:28.550
on and off

43:28.550 --> 43:29.510
for 20 years.

43:30.070 --> 43:32.330
It's been only a year since we made peace.

43:32.630 --> 43:34.290
How can he be so certain

43:34.880 --> 43:37.410
that we can let our guard down
against Beiman?

43:37.640 --> 43:39.480
Unless he is certain Beiman

43:39.510 --> 43:40.970
will not tear up the treaty

43:41.280 --> 43:42.680
and start a war suddenly.

43:44.400 --> 43:46.330
But what gives him such certainty?

43:49.920 --> 43:51.650
There is only one explanation.

43:51.710 --> 43:52.840
My mentor has his own

43:52.920 --> 43:54.800
sources of information in Beiman.

43:54.800 --> 43:56.530
And this source of information

43:57.920 --> 43:59.440
is unknown to the Penal Court,

43:59.440 --> 44:01.150
the Hall of Literary Profundity,

44:01.150 --> 44:02.630
and even His Majesty.

44:04.280 --> 44:04.920
In other words,

44:04.920 --> 44:07.520
it operates independently
outside the Court.

44:08.000 --> 44:10.920
I'll enter the palace now to
seek an audience with His Majesty.

44:10.920 --> 44:11.590
Next time we meet,

44:11.590 --> 44:13.110
pick somewhere more secure.

44:13.110 --> 44:13.840
Don't worry.

44:14.030 --> 44:15.160
No one will find out.

44:30.480 --> 44:34.500
[A Splendid Match]
